  "prefLabel": "He-W 806.55 Deemed Income",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 806.55 Deemed Income. Income deemed from a parent or legal guardian to a minor casehead, when the casehead lives with the parent or legal guardian, shall be verified in the same manner as income of an adult category assistance group member, unless otherwise designated.\n\nSource. #13414, eff 7-26-22",
